{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":39,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"To the choir director, to Jeduthun. A Psalm of David","tok":[{"t":"To the choir director, to "},{"t":"Jeduthun","s":["H3038"],"a":[1]},{"t":". A "},{"t":"Psalm","s":["H4210"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"David","s":["H1732"],"a":[3]}]},{"n":1,"text":"I said, I will keep my ways, So that I do not sin with my tongue; I will keep a muzzle on my mouth When the wicked are before me.","tok":[{"t":"I "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[0]},{"t":", I will keep my "},{"t":"ways","s":["H1870"],"a":[2]},{"t":", So that I do not "},{"t":"sin","s":["H2398"],"a":[3]},{"t":" with my "},{"t":"tongue","s":["H3956"],"a":[4]},{"t":"; I will "},{"t":"keep","s":["H8104"],"a":[5]},{"t":" a muzzle on my "},{"t":"mouth","s":["H6310"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"When","s":["H4269"],"a":[7]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7563"],"a":[9]},{"t":" are before me."}]},{"n":2,"text":"I was dumb and silent; I held my peace, even from good; And my pain was stirred up.","tok":[{"t":"I was "},{"t":"dumb","s":["H0481"],"a":[0]},{"t":" and silent; I held my "},{"t":"peace","s":["H2814"],"a":[2]},{"t":", even from "},{"t":"good","s":["H2896"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; And my pain was "},{"t":"stirred","s":["H5916"],"a":[5]},{"t":" up."}]},{"n":3,"text":"My heart was hot within me; While I mused, the fire burned; I spoke with my tongue:","tok":[{"t":"My "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[1]},{"t":" was "},{"t":"hot","s":["H2552"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"within","s":["H7130"],"a":[2]},{"t":" me; While I "},{"t":"mused","s":["H1901"],"a":[3]},{"t":", the "},{"t":"fire","s":["H0784"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"burned","s":["H1197"],"a":[4]},{"t":"; "},{"t":"I","s":["H0227"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"spoke","s":["H1696"],"a":[6]},{"t":" with my "},{"t":"tongue","s":["H3956"],"a":[7]},{"t":":"}]},{"n":4,"text":"O Jehovah, cause me to know my end, And the measure of my days, what it is. May I know how transient I am.","tok":[{"t":"O "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":", cause me to "},{"t":"know","s":["H3045"],"a":[0]},{"t":" my "},{"t":"end","s":["H7093"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And the "},{"t":"measure","s":["H4060"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of my "},{"t":"days","s":["H3117"],"a":[4]},{"t":", what it is. May I "},{"t":"know","s":["H3045"],"a":[7]},{"t":" how transient I am."}]},{"n":5,"text":"Behold, You have made my days as mere handbreadths, And my lifetime is as nothing before You; Surely every man at his best is altogether vanity. Selah","tok":[{"t":"Behold, You have "},{"t":"made","s":["H5414"],"a":[2]},{"t":" my "},{"t":"days","s":["H3117"],"a":[3]},{"t":" as mere "},{"t":"handbreadths","s":["H2947"],"a":[1]},{"t":", And my lifetime is as nothing before You; Surely "},{"t":"every","s":["H3605"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"man","s":["H0120"],"a":[11]},{"t":" at his best is "},{"t":"altogether","s":["H3605"],"a":[10]},{"t":" "},{"t":"vanity","s":["H1892"],"a":[9]},{"t":". "},{"t":"Selah","s":["H5542"],"a":[13]}]},{"n":6,"text":"Surely man goes about as a semblance; Surely they bustle about in vain: He heaps up riches yet knows not Who will gather them.","tok":[{"t":"Surely "},{"t":"man","s":["H0376"],"a":[3]},{"t":" goes about as a semblance; Surely they bustle about in "},{"t":"vain","s":["H1892"],"a":[5]},{"t":": He heaps "},{"t":"up","s":["H6651"],"a":[7]},{"t":" riches yet "},{"t":"knows","s":["H3045"],"a":[9]},{"t":" not Who will "},{"t":"gather","s":["H0622"],"a":[11]},{"t":" them."}]},{"n":7,"text":"And now what am I waiting for, O Lord? My hope — it is in You.","tok":[{"t":"And now what am I "},{"t":"waiting","s":["H6960"],"a":[2]},{"t":" for, O "},{"t":"Lord","s":["H0136"],"a":[3]},{"t":"? "},{"t":"My","s":["H6960"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"hope","s":["H8431"],"a":[4]},{"t":" — it is in You."}]},{"n":8,"text":"Deliver me from all my transgressions; Do not make me the fool’s reproach.","tok":[{"t":"Deliver","s":["H5337"],"a":[2]},{"t":" me from all my "},{"t":"transgressions","s":["H6588"],"a":[1]},{"t":"; Do not "},{"t":"make","s":["H7760"],"a":[6]},{"t":" me the fool’s "},{"t":"reproach","s":["H2781"],"a":[3]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":9,"text":"I was dumb; I did not open my mouth; For You have done this.","tok":[{"t":"I was "},{"t":"dumb","s":["H0481"],"a":[0]},{"t":"; I did not "},{"t":"open","s":["H6605"],"a":[2]},{"t":" my "},{"t":"mouth","s":["H6310"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; For You have done this."}]},{"n":10,"text":"Remove Your plague from me; By the hostility of Your hand I am consumed.","tok":[{"t":"Remove","s":["H5493"],"a":[0]},{"t":" Your plague from me; By the hostility of Your "},{"t":"hand","s":["H3027"],"a":[4]},{"t":" I am "},{"t":"consumed","s":["H3615"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":11,"text":"With rebukes You chasten a man because of iniquity, And cause what is desirous to him to disappear like a moth. Surely every man is vanity. Selah","tok":[{"t":"With "},{"t":"rebukes","s":["H8433"],"a":[0]},{"t":" You chasten a "},{"t":"man","s":["H0376"],"a":[4]},{"t":" because of "},{"t":"iniquity","s":["H5771"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And cause what is desirous to him to disappear like a "},{"t":"moth","s":["H6211"],"a":[6]},{"t":". Surely every "},{"t":"man","s":["H0120"],"a":[11]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"vanity","s":["H1892"],"a":[9]},{"t":". "},{"t":"Selah","s":["H5542"],"a":[12]}]},{"n":12,"text":"Hear my prayer, O Jehovah; And give ear to my cry; Do not hold Your peace at my tears. For I am a stranger with You, A sojourner, as all my fathers were.","tok":[{"t":"Hear","s":["H8085"],"a":[0]},{"t":" my "},{"t":"prayer","s":["H8605"],"a":[1]},{"t":", O "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; And give "},{"t":"ear","s":["H0238"],"a":[4]},{"t":" to my "},{"t":"cry","s":["H7775"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; Do not hold Your "},{"t":"peace","s":["H2790"],"a":[8]},{"t":" at my "},{"t":"tears","s":["H1832"],"a":[6]},{"t":". For I am a "},{"t":"stranger","s":["H1616"],"a":[10]},{"t":" with You, A "},{"t":"sojourner","s":["H8453"],"a":[13]},{"t":", as all my "},{"t":"fathers","s":["H0001"],"a":[15]},{"t":" were."}]},{"n":13,"text":"Look away from me, that I may be cheerful, Before I go away and am no more."}]}
